+     * (devotion to blue covers the library), when the library is nearly gone, or when the Consultation or the Pact can
+     * be cast with it this turn (the sure line). Casting it as a 1/3 that scries throws the win away.
+     */
+    public static boolean heldWinner(final Player ai, final SpellAbility sa) {
+        if (ai == null || sa == null || !sa.isSpell()) {
